    hZ hCk hCO hCH hX hQK hQP hk hpow hrow hlogH hPowUpper hQwidth hd hd1 hell0 hO hzcap hshift
    hNs heH heza heN hδ0 hδη hrowcap hslotcap hconst hbudget hXi hKcap hPcap hexp
